    "uncertainty": "Can public, calibration-charged routing among fixed factor-base charts lower conditional solve cost while preserving target coverage and total storage accounting?",
    "minimal_design_inputs": [
      "Freeze charts, union/overlap storage, at most eight public routing predicates, a separate fully charged calibration set, deterministic priority rule and held-out target set.",
      "Retain constant-router/single-chart identity, identical-chart zero-gain, hidden-scalar leakage and relabeled association controls."
    ],
    "technical_blockers": [
      "The chart family, predicate grammar and failure/descent rules are not yet fixed inputs.",
      "Rank and target coverage must be measured after routing; a changed conditional mean is not a changed mean tuple count."
    ],
